    "body": "Three statements are given. \n\n(I) If $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty} a_n$ does not exist, then $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} a_n$ is divergent.\n\n(II) If $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} a_n$ is divergent, then $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\neq0$\n\n(III) If $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty} a_n = \\frac{1}{2}$, then $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} a_n$ is divergent.\n\nSelect all TRUE statement(s) from above.",
